  "description": "High input with Drive engaged, both gain controls, cold clipper and three-band EQ. Fixed supply rails and bypassed effects loop. Includes the Laney GH100L 2188 four-EL34 output stage, Presence and Resonance circuits at the 4 Ω feedback tap. Transformer winding parameters are estimated.",
